# SHOTLIST v4.1 2026-11-07 (shots 3, 6, 7 recomposed after 319c and 5eee: overlap, carpet void, tiny Nelim); v4 2026-11-07 (shootGallery 9.0; rate-gallery of v3.4 under the 2026-11-07 rules: decor sparse, story not readable in 5 to 8, captures 1 2 3 4 8 REDO; Opus director pass, kept in part, see STATUS.md). Supersedes v3.4.
# Story: the keeper's day with the Megafauna herd. Evening round on the clearing and at the pond (18h to 19h: she brings wood, feeds the otters and the scorpions, sits by the fire as the herd settles), then NEXT MORNING breakfast round over four places (06h30 to 09h30: she feeds browsers, grazers, hunters, then sits among the resting herd). Nelim (NSB, only colonist) keeps teal Apparel_CollarShirt rgb (24, 74, 84) and Apparel_Pants rgb (16, 52, 60), own face, smile in every shot (MouthSmile), ponytail canon.
# Time: Clear every shot. Evening start 18h, cumulative waits 60, 893, 1727, 2350 ticks (18:00, 18:20, 18:40, 19:00); morning hours 6, 7, 8, 9 plus 1250 ticks.
# Frame rule: crop of the 1920x1080 capture, never below 1280x720; evening shots 96 px per cell (20x11), morning shots 80 px per cell (24x13.5), Nelim faces South where the job allows. Animals 2 cells apart, three hues of different brightness. Decor grouped around the subject, ground not bare, a light source in frame; nothing on the cell south of a pawn (hides legs), no hay or meat under a body. One Ingest job running in every shot.
#   1. mammoths-fire. 18h bare-clearing, WIDE opener, crop (184, 146) to (204, 157). Campfire (193, 152) lit, TorchLamp (203, 148) lit, Brazier (187, 155) lit, woodpile 4 WoodLog (190, 150), Stool (191, 155), Hay scatter (195, 149) (196, 156) (188, 149), Plant_Daylily (188, 147) (188, 157) (195, 147) (202, 156). 3 WoollyMammoth: one ingests Hay (199, 153) at (198, 153), one at (203, 149) walks South (front view), one at (200, 155). Nelim at (189, 152) hauls WoodLog to (192, 152), paused 25 ticks mid-stride, smile (MouthSmile). Instant: the last logs for the fire. Says: "She brings wood to the fire."
#   2. otters-bank. 18h water-garden, crop (146, 169) to (160, 177). 3 lit TorchLamp (147, 170) (158, 173) (156, 169), lit Brazier (146, 176), PlantPot_Bonsai (147, 172), Stool (146, 173), Plant_Daylily (148, 172) (156, 170) (146, 175) (157, 175). two stacks of 4 Meat_Muffalo at (152, 172) and (151, 174), one per otter, plus a third visible stack of 4 at (154, 172) left on the bank (v4.3: the first capture showed no meat, bodies hid the stacks): 2 Enhydriodon ingest it, third lies at (155, 171), 3 hues. Nelim at (152, 170) carries Meat_Muffalo, faces South toward them, smile. Instant: she set the meat down, the otters have reached it. Says: "She feeds the otters."
#   3. scorpions-meat. 18h bare-clearing, crop (192, 148) to (203, 156). Campfire (193, 152) lit, TorchLamp (197, 149) lit, Brazier (202, 155) lit, woodpile 9 WoodLog (193, 148) (4 plus the 5 hauled in shot 1), Hay (195, 148) (195, 155) (202, 153), Plant_Daylily (192, 149) (192, 155) (196, 148) (202, 148). v4.1: ONE Meat_Muffalo stack of 3 per scorpion, each 3 cells from the others (stacks at (202, 151) (200, 154) (199, 149); bodies ingest on their own stack and no longer converge, no overlap), 3 Pulmonoscorpius, 3 hues. Nelim at (196, 152) hauls Meat_Muffalo to (197, 152), 3 cells from the nearest scorpion and not touching it, paused 60 ticks, smile. Instant: she has just set the meat down. Says: "She feeds the scorpions."
#   4. herd-settles. 18h bare-clearing, closer, crop (187, 148) to (201, 156). Campfire (193, 152) lit, TorchLamp (190, 148) (190, 156) lit, Brazier (200, 149) lit, Stool (191, 153) with Nelim seated, smile, woodpile 9 WoodLog (190, 150), Hay (196, 153) (194, 148) (194, 155) (199, 148), Plant_Daylily (188, 149) (188, 155) (199, 156) (194, 156). 3 Chalicotherium: two lie at (196, 150) and (198, 154), one at (203, 152) ingests Hay (196, 153). Instant: the herd settles. Says: "She sits by the fire while the herd settles."
#   5. browsers-breakfast. 6h enclosure-south (v4.2: enclosure-north is overgrown with bamboo, Uintatherium found no clear area; cells shifted by (-17, -21), guessed), crop (147, 211) to (163, 221) (v4.6, tighter, no object on the flower field west of x 153). TorchLamp (142, 218) lit, TorchLamp (158, 212) lit, Stool (161, 216), Brazier (160, 219) lit, Hay (153, 216) (156, 212) (156, 216) (154, 219) (154, 216) (155, 213), WoodLog (144, 211), Stool (141, 215), Plant_Daylily (141, 212) (141, 220) (159, 221) (161, 211). Nelim at (150, 215) hauls Hay to (155, 213), back three-quarter, smile. Deinotherium ingests at (152, 215), Platybelodon walks to (155, 219), Uintatherium ingests at (154, 219); background Macrauchenia (156, 214), Castoroides (158, 220), Josephoartigasia (153, 212) lie (v4.5, 160 213 not standable in e262). Instant: the first hay reaches the browsers. Says: "Breakfast for the great browsers."
#   6. grazers-breakfast. 7h exhibition-zone, v4.1 moved 10 cells West onto the grass so the frame holds no carpet edge and no dark void squares, crop (190, 162) to (205, 172) (z 162 and up: water at the south-west corner is out of frame). Brazier (198, 170) lit, Stool (193, 165), Hay (195, 166) (201, 165) (199, 168), Plant_Daylily (195, 171) (195, 163) (193, 167) (203, 171). Nelim at (194, 166) hauls Hay to (198, 166), smile. Paraceratherium (202, 164) and Diprotodon (200, 169) ingest, Doedicurus (204, 167); background Gomphotaria (192, 163), Procoptodon (191, 170), Daeodon (204, 162) (6 animals kept: rule 5). Cells guessed from the first capture (grass x 200 to 209), read on the capture. Instant: she sets the hay down, the grazers lean in. Says: "Breakfast for the strange grazers."
#   7. hunters-breakfast. 8h rice-paddy forest edge, crop (224, 116) to (238, 126) (v4.1: tighter, 96 px per cell, Nelim at least 100 px tall). Brazier (224, 120) lit, WoodLog (238, 122) (238, 125) (237, 123), Meat_Muffalo stacks of 3 on bare ground, one per ingester, none under a body: (230, 121) (235, 121) and a third at (228, 121) that Nelim hauls to. Nelim at (226, 122), 3 cells from Smilodon, smile. Smilodon (231, 121) and Andrewsarchus (236, 120) ingest, Titanis (232, 125) walks, Megalania (233, 118) and Purussaurus (226, 117) lie. Instant: the meat lands, the cat reaches it. Says: "Breakfast for the hunters."
#   8. herd-rests. 9h calm-zone, closing, crop (193, 182) to (207, 191). Brazier (200, 184) lit, Stool (200, 187) with Nelim seated facing South, smile, TorchLamp (195, 190) (205, 190) lit, PlantPot_Bonsai (207, 187), Plant_Daylily (194, 186) (206, 187) (199, 183), 3 Hay at (202, 186). Elasmotherium ingests the last Hay, Zygolophodon (197, 188) front view, Sivatherium (204, 189), Dinocrocuta lies (206, 184), Arthropleura (196, 184). Instant: the last hay is eaten, she sits down. Says: "Breakfast is over; the herd rests around her."
# Steps used: the places, the face and the cleaning are Nelim's Sanctuary: steps; the jobs, the lying and sitting poses, the decor, the framing and the face are Nelim's Pickle Tools: steps; the spawn and coat steps are CoatSteps. The crop is a tool step after the run (Art/Gallery-clean).
